The sun was bright and the sand was warm

3
00:00:05,217 --> 00:00:07,801
My dad and I built a big sandcastle

4
00:00:07,977 --> 00:00:09,480
Mom read a book nearby

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,920
Then we swam together in the cool sea

6
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:14,480
We also ate ice cream which tasted great

7
00:00:14,698 --> 00:00:18,161
It was a wonderful day and we were all very happy

